     "body": "<p>Config now via system property:<br/>\nfedora.fesl.pep_nocache=true</p>\n\n<p>This will override PEP_NOCACHE environment variable if it is set.</p>\n\n<p>If the system property is not set, then the PEP_NOCACHE environment variable will still be used (ie existing installations will work as before).</p>\n\n<p>The PEP_NOCACHE environment variable configuration should be removed in a post-3.6 release, \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-1053\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-1053\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Remove PEP_NOCACHE environment variable configuration for disabling FeSL policy results caching\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-1053\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n raised for this</p>",
     "created": "24/Jan/12 11:20 AM",
