  "description": "<p>FeSL's XACML caches policy evaluation results, so that policies are not re-evaluated for repeated access to the same resource etc.</p>\n\n<p>This is currently configurable - the caching can be disabled by setting PEP_NOCACHE=true as an environment variable.</p>\n\n<p>This should instead be an option in a config file, FeSL should not depend on environment variables.</p>",
